    "description": "Taskflow multi-tenant API \u2014 all endpoints tested against http://localhost:3000 (see grub collection). Auth is cookie-based (tokens cookie). Login request auto-saves accessToken/refreshToken/userId. Project/Task requests use {{orgId}} (Acme) and {{projectId}}/{{taskId}} auto-captured.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Import this file into Postman (File > Import).\n2. Run 'Auth > Login - Alice' (sets cookies automatically via Set-Cookie header). Postman will store 'tokens' cookie for subsequent requests.\n3. Run Project/Task flows in order: Create Project -> Get Org Projects -> Get/Update/Delete Project; Create Task -> List -> Get/Update/Delete Task; Members: Add/List/Update/Remove.\n\nSeed users (password: password123): alice@taskflow.dev (org_admin Acme), bob@taskflow.dev, carol@taskflow.dev, dave@taskflow.dev (org_admin Globex), eve@taskflow.dev. Orgs: Acme Corp (b237e9cc-...) , Globex Inc (cda8a6fd-...)."
  },
